municipal obligations funding the construction ofthe municipal courthouse, the Consultant
will bill the City and the City agrees to pay Consultant as follows:
a.
For services as municipal finance counsel, a fixed fee not to exceed thirty-five
thousand dollars ($35,000.00);
b.
Expenses not to exceed two thousand five hundred dollars ($2,500.00), reimbursable
upon presentation of a full accounting of such expenses.
c.
