disclosure document, an additional fixed fee not to exceed fifteen thousand dollars
($15,000.00) shall be paid.
Compensation shall be contingent upon a successful closing of the financing for the
project(s).
Compensation for additional services requested and performed by the Consultant as
municipal finance counsel will be billed at the hourly rates of the attorneys providing such
services with prior authorization from the City.
