A. The successful firm will be expected to enter into a professional services agreement
with the City. The contents of this RFP and all provisions of the successful proposal
deemed pertinent by the City may be incorporated into a contract and become legally
binding. A copy of a draft professional services agreement is attached to this REP;
please note, the actual terms and conditions of the final agreement may differ.
